 <volume>20</volume>:<fpage>5782</fpage>&#x02013;5791.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10908619</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib48"><citation citation-type="journal">Yu, W., D.J. Sharp, R. Kuriyama, P. Mallik, and P.W. Baas. <year>1997</year>. Inhibition of a mitotic motor compromises the formation of dendrite-like processes from neuroblastoma cells. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>136</volume>:<fpage>659</fpage>&#x02013;668.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9024695</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib49"><citation citation-type="journal">Yuste, R., and T. Bonhoeffer. <year>2004</year>. Genesis of dendritic spines: insights from ultrastructural and imaging studies. <source>Nat. Rev. Neurosci.</source> <volume>5</volume>:<fpage>24</fpage>&#x02013;34.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14708001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib50"><citation citation-type="journal">Zito, K., D. Parnas, R.D. Fetter, E.Y. Isacoff, and C.S. Goodman. <year>1999</year>. Watching a synapse grow: noninvasive confocal imaging of synaptic growth in <italic>Drosophila</italic>. <source>Neuron.</source> <volume>22</volume>:<fpage>719</fpage>&#x02013;729.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10230792</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>